* ============================================================
* Workspace Relation Save/Load Smoke Test - DTSHEMA 2 live path
* ============================================================
* Purpose:
*   Verify WORKSPACE SAVE/LOAD restores live areas plus relation graph.
*
* Scope:
*   Non-destructive.
*   Uses WORKSPACE command path only.
*   Uses MCC sandbox relationship chain.
*
* Expected:
*   WORKSPACE OPEN DBF opens sandbox DBFs.
*   REL ADD creates relation graph.
*   REL LIST shows relations before save.
*   WORKSPACE SAVE writes relation-aware workspace.
*   WORKSPACE CLOSE clears relations.
*   WORKSPACE LOAD restores areas and relation graph.
*   REL LIST after load should match before save.
* ============================================================

ECHO ============================================================
ECHO WORKSPACE RELATION SAVE/LOAD SMOKE
ECHO ============================================================

DO SANDBOX

ECHO
ECHO --- CLEAN START ---
WORKSPACE CLOSE
REL LIST

ECHO
ECHO --- OPEN CONFIGURED DBF SLOT ---
WORKSPACE OPEN DBF
WORKSPACE

ECHO
ECHO --- SELECT ROOT TABLE ---
SELECT STUDENTS
AREA
RECNO

ECHO
ECHO --- ADD RELATION GRAPH ---
REL CLEAR ALL
REL ADD STUDENTS ENROLL ON SID
REL ADD STUDENTS STUD_MAJ ON SID
REL ADD STUDENTS MAJORS ON MAJOR
REL ADD ENROLL CLASSES ON CLS_ID
REL ADD CLASSES COURSES ON CID
REL ADD CLASSES TERMS ON TERM
REL ADD CLASSES ROOMS ON ROOM
REL ADD CLASSES TEACHERS ON TID
REL ADD CLASSES TASSIGN ON CLS_ID
REL ADD COURSES DEPT ON DEPT_ID
REL ADD ROOMS BUILDING ON BLDG
REL ADD TEACHERS DEPT ON DEPT_ID
REL ADD TASSIGN TEACHERS ON TID
REL ADD STUD_MAJ MAJORS ON MAJOR
REL ADD MAJORS DEPT ON DEPT_ID

ECHO
ECHO --- RELATIONS BEFORE SAVE ---
REL LIST ALL

ECHO
ECHO --- REFRESH AND ENUM CHECK BEFORE SAVE ---
SELECT STUDENTS
GOTO 1
REL REFRESH
REL LIST
REL ENUM LIMIT 10 ENROLL CLASSES COURSES TUPLE STUDENTS.SID,STUDENTS.LNAME,ENROLL.CLS_ID,CLASSES.CID,COURSES.TITLE

ECHO
ECHO --- SAVE RELATION WORKSPACE ---
WORKSPACE SAVE workspace_rel_smoke.dtschema

ECHO
ECHO --- CLOSE WORKSPACE ---
WORKSPACE CLOSE
WORKSPACE
REL LIST

ECHO
ECHO --- LOAD RELATION WORKSPACE ---
WORKSPACE LOAD workspace_rel_smoke.dtshema
WORKSPACE

ECHO
ECHO --- RELATIONS AFTER LOAD ---
REL LIST ALL

ECHO
ECHO --- REFRESH AND ENUM CHECK AFTER LOAD ---
SELECT STUDENTS
GOTO 1
REL REFRESH
REL LIST
REL ENUM LIMIT 10 ENROLL CLASSES COURSES TUPLE STUDENTS.SID,STUDENTS.LNAME,ENROLL.CLS_ID,CLASSES.CID,COURSES.TITLE

ECHO
ECHO --- LEGACY SHIM CHECK ---
SCHEMAS

ECHO
ECHO ============================================================
ECHO WORKSPACE RELATION SAVE/LOAD SMOKE DONE
ECHO ============================================================
